# The CLI build reads the module files and the `cli/` package. An
# allowlist keeps the operator sources, the Rust crates, and the docs out
# of this build context, so a change to them does not rebuild this image.
*
!go.mod
!go.sum
!cli/
# go build never reads a test file or testdata, so a test-only edit does not rebuild this image.
**/*_test.go
**/testdata/
